{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Underwater World - DLC Models Package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By combining this DLC package with the existing Underwater Filter in RPG Stories VTT, you can expand your world-building and gameplay with a detailed collection of 3D models perfect for Underwater Adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A diverse collection of corals and rocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New marine creatures and underwater characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shipwrecks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577670/extras/UW_gif.gif?t=1741863422\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a Game Master using this package, your players can view your maps online even if they don't own it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This package is <strong><u>included</u></strong> in the Wrath of Devs Expansion. If you have backed that campaign, then you do not need to purchase this.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577670?t=1741863422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577670?t=1741863422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577670/02f9b8a7bfd28c7452f37fb5aa505242a837441b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741863422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577670/02f9b8a7bfd28c7452f37fb5aa505242a837441b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741863422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Onli